<title>HUNGARY: Hungary 2nd beet test shows 13 pct sugar content.</title>
<headline>Hungary 2nd beet test shows 13 pct sugar content.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sugar content at Hungary's second 1997/98 sugar beet test was 13 percent compared with 15 percent at the second test last year, the trade group Sugar Industry Association said on Friday.</p>
<p>						   1997/98     1996/97</p>
<p> Average sugar weight (grams/root)	 79.8	   96.9</p>
<p> Sugar content per beet (pct)		13.0	   15.0</p>
<p> Average weight of roots (grams/root)   614.0	  646.0</p>
<p> Average leaf weight (grams/root)	 619.0	  522.0</p>
<p>NOTE: The roots tested were picked on August 11. The next test results will be released on August 29.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4042</p>
</text>
